    "scope": {
      "zh": "中国市场2027款全能荣耀款燃油CR-V共4个版本，逐列提取厂家现行fuelVehicleData；不混入e:HEV。活力、风尚、风尚7座为两驱，风尚四驱为五座。合并单元格按官网实际列顺序展开；发动机142 kW/243 N·m。未明示加速、极速及转向位置，保留空值。不沿用旧2026款装备；仅展示本次厂家表明确列出的部分配置，选装包条件以厂家及实车为准。",
      "en": "Four China-market 2027 All-Round Glory petrol CR-V trims, extracted column by column from the current official fuelVehicleData; e:HEV is excluded. Vitality, Style and Style 7-seat are 2WD; Style AWD has five seats. Merged cells follow the rendered official column order. Engine output is 142 kW/243 N·m. Acceleration, maximum speed and steering position are unlisted and remain null. No old 2026 equipment is carried over. Selected current official equipment only; option packages are subject to manufacturer and actual-vehicle conditions."
    }
